    143  1118							; SMART CHORD / EXTENSIONS: each held note becomes a chord built in the key.
    144  1118							; A note in the scale gets its diatonic chord (stacked scale thirds: triad,
    145  1118							; or 7 / 9 / 11 / 13 with extensions). A note outside the scale gets a
    146  1118							; major triad (+ b7, 9, 11, 13). Results merge, ascending, at most 8.
